WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.155
The first to stay.

00:01.862 --> 00:06.852
Viking 1 landed here in the summer of 1976 and worked for six years.

00:07.346 --> 00:11.012
Its twin came down on the other side of the planet six weeks later.

00:11.501 --> 00:14.791
They tested the soil for life, and the answer was unclear.

00:15.419 --> 00:17.154
That is why we kept coming back.
